    "stem": "Rohit notes that rain still seeps into open ground near his home, yet the neighbourhood tube wells have run lower for several years. More water is pumped out, plant cover has fallen, and a new paved schoolyard covers soil that once soaked up rain.\n\nWhy can groundwater decrease even though some water still seeps in?",
